  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1771079590_5039466_cc1afa2824d575c6192f71c0ae95c5a4.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:32px;\"><strong>ZENE Bricks – Affiliate Program Overview</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>About Brand</strong></span></p><p>ZENE Bricks is built on a simple yet powerful philosophy:</p><p><strong>Z – Zen, E – Endless, N – Nurture, E – Enlighten.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>We aim to inspire builders around the world by enhancing creativity and delivering a more immersive building experience. At ZENE Bricks, we don’t just build—we elevate how bricks are experienced, bringing models to life in entirely new ways.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>Our Products</strong></span></p><p>ZENE Bricks focuses on lighting and power solutions for brick builds, designed to transform static models into dynamic displays.</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Lighting Kits – Unlock Night Mode for Your Bricks</span></strong></p><p>Our main product line brings your builds to life after dark. We offer lighting kits for a wide range of popular themes, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Sci-Fi Builds</strong> – starships, space scenes, and futuristic models</li><li><strong>Magic Worlds</strong> – castles, schools, and fantasy environments</li><li><strong>Racing &amp; Supercars</strong> – F1 cars and high-performance vehicles</li><li><strong>Modular Buildings &amp; City Series</strong> – streets, shops, and architecture</li></ul><p>From subtle ambient lighting to detailed highlight effects, our kits turn ordinary builds into eye-catching displays—perfect for showcasing, content creation, and collectors.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Power Functions &amp; Motorized Kits</strong></span></p><p>Core Products. Add motion and interactivity to your creations. ZENE Bricks motorized kits are designed for specific builds, including <strong>F1 racing models</strong> and holiday classics like <strong>lego Christmas trains</strong>, bringing both speed and festive charm to your bricks.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>High-Performance Power Systems</strong></span></p><p>Engineered for advanced builders, these upgraded components deliver <strong>stronger output, higher speed, and more precise control</strong>. Primarily designed for F1 models, they offer significantly faster performance compared to power function kits.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>MOC Accessories</strong></span></p><p>Expand customization with parts designed for <strong>hands-on, experienced builders</strong>. Perfect for those who enjoy creating unique, self-designed builds and pushing the limits of their creativity.</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>What Makes Us Different</strong></span></p><ol><li><strong>Lighting-Focused Innovation: </strong>We specialize in lighting—designed specifically for brick models, not generic LEDs.</li><li><strong>Content-Friendly Products: </strong>Highly visual and perfect for <strong>YouTube, TikTok, and Instagram</strong> —great for affiliate conversion.</li><li><strong>Easy Installation</strong>: Builder-friendly designs with clear instructions.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Wide Theme Coverage</strong></span></p><p>From sci-fi to city builds, appealing to multiple fan communities.</p><ul><li>Strong Conversion Potential</li><li>Visually impactful (before/after effect)</li><li>Ideal for video demonstrations</li><li>High engagement in niche communities</li></ul><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>Affiliate Program</strong></span></p><p>Join the ZENE Bricks Affiliate Program and grow with us:</p><ul><li><strong>5% Commission</strong> on every successful order</li><li><strong>60-Day Cookie Duration</strong> to maximize conversions</li><li><strong>Multiple Promotion Methods Supported</strong> – websites, blogs, YouTube, TikTok, social media, and more</li></ul><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>How to Promote</strong></span></p><ul><li>Video Content – before/after lighting transformations perform extremely well</li><li>Build Showcases &amp; Reviews</li><li>Short-Form Content (TikTok / Reels / Shorts)</li><li>Tutorials &amp; Installation Guides</li><li>Community Sharing (Reddit, Discord, forums)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>Additional Benefits</strong></span></p><ol><li>Access to marketing assets (images, product info)</li><li>Regular promotions &amp; discount campaigns to boost conversion</li><li>Affiliate support to help you grow</li><li>Products that naturally generate high engagement content</li></ol><p><br></p><p>ZENE Bricks is not just selling accessories—we’re creating a new way to experience builds.</p><p>Turn your audience’s creations into something they can see—even in the dark. <strong>Join us and start earning today.</strong></p></div>",
